# DVC remote placeholder — the human supplies the actual S3 bucket. Do NOT commit
# real bucket names, account IDs, or keys. To configure:
#
#   dvc remote add -d storage s3://<YOUR_BUCKET>/quantum-grid-attack-detection-benchmark
#   dvc remote modify storage region <YOUR_REGION>
#
# Credentials come from the ambient AWS environment / instance role (never written here).
